From: Chad Monroe <chad@monroe.io>
Date: Wed, 03 Jun 2026 07:22:29 -0700
Subject: net: airoha: provide weak EphyMonitor stub in arht_dp_api

The vendor datapath API calls EphyMonitor(), a routine from the EPHY/switch
PHY driver that is not built for the AN7581/EN7581 PON target, leaving the
kernel link with an undefined ref. Provide a __weak no-op so the link
resolves; the real implementation takes precedence if that driver is ever
built in.

Signed-off-by: Chad Monroe <chad@monroe.io>
---
 drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/arht_dp_api.c |    6 +++++-
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/arht_dp_api.c
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/arht_dp_api.c
@@ -61,7 +61,11 @@ extern int (*dynamic_ifc_pingpong_hook)(
 extern spinlock_t ppe_lock, flow_offload_lock;
 extern unchar ethmac_addr[6];
 
-extern void EphyMonitor(void);
+/* EphyMonitor lives in the EPHY/switch PHY driver, which is out of scope
+ * for AN7581 PON; provide a weak no-op so the link resolves and the real
+ * implementation wins if that driver is ever built in.
+ */
+void __weak EphyMonitor(void) { }
 extern int g_pon_serdes_eth;
 
 /* airoha pon onu type
